<title>GERMANY: Continental 1996 EPS 2.32 dmk vs 1.52 dmk.</title>
<headline>Continental 1996 EPS 2.32 dmk vs 1.52 dmk.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group DVFA earnings per share	  2.32    vs 1.52 marks</p>
<p>    Group net income			   192.5   vs 155.2</p>
<p>    Group DVFA earnings			219.2   vs 143.0</p>
<p>    Group number of shares (millions)    94.48   vs 93.93</p>
<p>    Group global sales			 10,430  vs 10,252</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    46,441  vs 48,366</p>
<p>    Group net cash-flow			814.6   vs 779.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German tyre manufacturer is Continental AG.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
